Thanks, Nomura-kun!

00:17:16.190 --> 00:17:19.220
Oh no, not at all!

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.720
Looks like you’ve done it, Ryuu.

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:35.580
I cannot let this one escape my clutches.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:39.580
Making a girl suffer, that’s the worst as a guy!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:42.910
First, for Kokoro-chan!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.290
And, for those three girls!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.980
It’s time.

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:20.340
What? Why?

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:30.080
What? I wonder why?

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:33.590
Because it’s about someone else?

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:37.360
Well, it’s not my hatred, anyway.

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:40.830
Well, I decided once, so…

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.060
I’ll try again tomorrow, I guess.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:44.420
If it doesn’t work.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:48.240
Who are you?

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:51.090
Jigoku Shoujo.

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:55.870
What? I connected? What should I do?

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:58.240
The person I want to send to Hell is…

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.170
The one destined for Hell…

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:00.830
…is you.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:03.860
Umm… What?

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:07.390
There is someone who wants to send you to Hell.

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:10.350
W-Who?

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:17.370
I hate this! Why was I so open to someone like him?

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:22.550
Because it’s about that guy, he’ll tell everyone!

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.920
Then I can’t walk in the city!

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:26.410
I’ll be laughed at!

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.540
I can’t bear that.

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.900
So…

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:37.380
Disappear!

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.880
That’s how it is.

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:42.910
How horrible!

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:50.760
Your grudge is received.

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:58.070
Wonderful
work!

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:03.220
First is scissor-Hell!

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:10.000
GYOEHHHHH!

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:13.530
Next is boiling pot-Hell!

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:17.800
What?

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:18.960
Oh!

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:27.600
HYEEEEEEEE!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.850
Let me show you heat-Hell.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:42.200
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.610
Needle Hell. Let’s go.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.960
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.560
Fold him!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:01.540
Fly!

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:17.140
O pitiful shadow, wandering in darkness.

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:22.310
Scarring people and degrading them.

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:27.350
The ball of Karma is drowned in sin.

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:34.160
Do you want to die this once?

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:40.470
I don’t want to die!

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.590
Don’t be so down, Nozomi!

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:52.030
Yes, it’s been a week already!

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:54.930
Forget such a horrible guy!

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:56.870
Don’t say horrible!

00:21:56.870 --> 00:21:58.510
Something probably came up!

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:03.550
Nomura-san, must had some deep reason to run away!

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:14.520
Next time wear a bikini.

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:18.100
Y-Yeah, I’ll think about it.

00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:20.050
Changing room

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.450
We swam a lot!

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:27.300
I was told that… but I’m in trouble.

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:39.870
Note: Candle says, Sasayama Kokoro.

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:39.870
I shall release your grudge.

00:24:10.640 --> 00:24:13.290
The place closest to Hell…

00:24:13.290 --> 00:24:15.810
That’s what this city is called.

00:24:15.810 --> 00:24:19.850
One summer evening, we ferry souls down the river.

00:24:19.850 --> 00:24:25.230
Then, for just a moment, the gates to Hell are opened.

00:24:25.230 --> 00:24:27.000
And that night…

00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:30.490
We received something from Ojou.

00:24:30.490 --> 00:24:33.260
Oops, Ojou, she moved too.

00:24:34.010 --> 00:24:35.810
A start, eh?

00:24:36.440 --> 00:24:39.260
Next time: The Six-Script Lantern.
